# action device control — list an action again to add an alternative
move_left keyboard A
move_left keyboard Left
move_left gamepad dpleft
move_right keyboard D
move_right keyboard Right
move_right gamepad dpright
move_up keyboard W
move_up keyboard Up
move_up gamepad dpup
move_down keyboard S
move_down keyboard Down
move_down gamepad dpdown
route keyboard Z
route keyboard U
route gamepad a
menu keyboard Escape
menu keyboard 2
menu gamepad start
ui_accept keyboard Return
ui_accept keyboard Z
ui_accept gamepad a
ui_back keyboard X
ui_back gamepad b
